rows.assumption:
These parsers assume the queue holds one item:
- x.replace(/ Apply Dismiss.*$/, '') keeps only the text before the first item's buttons;
- RECOVM keeps at most 4 elements of at most 160 chars each;
- the notes print only banners[0].
With a queue titled 'N block edits are waiting', the words in the 2nd and later items read as 'lost' and are cut from the notes.
